	"Description": "[size=3][b]Description[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3]All folders simply contain config files for various mods within the collection.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3]Should work out of the box, but if Vortex tells you to \"Manage Rules\", Mega Configured Stardew will always load after other mods.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Main features[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Configures mod settings within the collection so you don't have to.[/color][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Mega Expanded Stardew.[/color][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3][b]Shout outs[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#D4D4D8][size=3]JennaJuffuffles, for the idea to include pre-configured files.[/size][/color]",
